# CloudPDF Studio — Frontend Environment Configuration
# ======================================================

# API Base URL:
# - Leave empty (default) when deployed to Cloudflare Pages (API proxied via Pages Function to API_ORIGIN),
#   when running behind a reverse proxy (e.g., Nginx on EC2), or when using Vite dev proxy.
# - Set to an absolute URL only for decoupled cross-origin development without a proxy.
VITE_API_URL=


